<font size="+2" color="#0000FF">二度目の幼なじみ</font><br>
<hr>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong>管理人</strong>  <i>2000/08/15 03:38:36</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
